OctaneOS patch for batocera-emulationstation (applied to the source by scripts/apply-es-patches.sh at build time).

RetroAchievements statistics and the home-carousel entry call retroachievements.org/API/..., which needs a Web API key.  Batocera compiles
in a private developer key (CHEEVOS_DEV_LOGIN); community builds have none, so the site answers 401 and the menu says "Unauthorized".
The player's login token is NOT accepted as a key (checked against the live API).  This patch lets each player use their own key
(retroachievements.org > Settings > Keys), stored per profile by batocera-profiles as global.retroachievements.apikey.

 - getApiUrl: with a username and a key set, the call carries z=<username>&y=<key>
 - getGameInfoAndUserProgress: no longer returns early when only the player's key is available
 - isScriptingSupported(RETROACHIEVEMENTS): always true, so the settings screen (where the key is typed) is reachable
 - RetroAchievement settings screen: a masked WEB API KEY row below PASSWORD

--- a/es-app/src/RetroAchievements.cpp
+++ b/es-app/src/RetroAchievements.cpp
@@ -141,6 +141,15 @@
 
 std::string RetroAchievements::getApiUrl(const std::string& method, const std::string& parameters)
 {
+	// OctaneOS: RetroAchievements' Web API needs an API key (z=<user>&y=<key>).  Without a built-in developer key (CHEEVOS_DEV_LOGIN),
+	// use the player's own Web API key (retroachievements.org > Settings > Keys).  The login token is NOT a Web API key (the site answers 401).
+	{
+		auto raUser = SystemConf::getInstance()->get("global.retroachievements.username");
+		auto raKey = SystemConf::getInstance()->get("global.retroachievements.apikey");
+		if (!raUser.empty() && !raKey.empty())
+			return "https://retroachievements.org/API/" + method + ".php?z=" + HttpReq::urlEncode(raUser) + "&y=" + HttpReq::urlEncode(raKey) + "&" + parameters;
+	}
+
 #ifdef CHEEVOS_DEV_LOGIN
 	auto options = std::string(CHEEVOS_DEV_LOGIN);
 	return "https://retroachievements.org/API/"+ method +".php?"+ options +"&" + parameters;
@@ -219,7 +228,8 @@
 	ret.ID = 0;
 
 #ifndef CHEEVOS_DEV_LOGIN
-	return ret;
+	if (SystemConf::getInstance()->get("global.retroachievements.apikey").empty())
+		return ret;
 #endif
 
 	auto options = getHttpOptions();
